    "directions": [
      "In a kadai, add oil, once it’s hot, add mustard seeds, garlic cloves, curry leaves and let it splutter.",
      "Add ginger, dry kashmiri red chillies and saute it for a minute.",
      "Add onions, tender coriander stems, salt to taste and cook it for 4-5 minutes until the onions are golden in colour.",
      "Add dry kashmiri red chillies, curry leaves and give it a good mix.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a pan or kadai, add oil, once it’s hot, add potatoes and shallow fry until golden in colour.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, turmeric powder and cook it for 4-5 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Add salt to taste, prepare tadka and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with prepared dal tadka and steam rice.",
      "In a handi, add prepared tadka, cooked dal, water to adjust the consistency and simmer it for 10-12 minutes on medium flames.",
      "Finish it with sugar, curry leaves, ghee and give it a good mix.",
      "Transfer it to a serving bowl and garnish it with coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with prepared spicy aloo and steam rice."
    ],
